flowchart LR
    A[Installer --sync] --> B[Build current manifest]
    B --> C{Previous manifest exists?}
    C -- No --> D[Do not prune unknown files]
    C -- Yes --> E[Select prior managed paths absent now]
    E --> F[Validate logical path]
    F --> G[Backup then remove stale managed file]
    D --> H[Backup and update current managed files]
    G --> H
    H --> R[Retain latest 10 backup runs]
    R --> I[Install dependencies and verify]
    I --> J[Atomically replace managed manifest]
    K[Unknown user files] --> L[Preserved]
    M[opencode.jsonc] --> L
